OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFrequent
OL,6,Fshowers brought on strong to near gale
OL,7,Fnorth to northwest winds will be
OL,8,Fwintry at times. Outbreaks heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes with hail and thunder probable.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FSpells of sunshine mixed with
OL,12,Fshowers, these most frequent across
OL,13,FShetland and through the morning.
OL,14,FStrong north to northwest winds
OL,15,Fgradually easing.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,18,FNortheast winds continuing to push a
OL,19,Fmix of scattered showers and brighter
OL,20,Fspells across the Northern Isles
OL,21,Fthrough the outlook period.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
